    Add system maintenance tools, admin governance report, and PDF export
    
    Adds a sysops app (audit/auth logs, alerts, backups, system config) with
    a new manage_system permission, unlock/force-logout actions, and a
    tabbed System Maintenance hub in the admin portal. Login lockout
    settings and the idle-logout timeout are now admin-configurable instead
    of hardcoded, and the admin dashboard/report views no longer bleed into
    officer-only operational data. Adds a governance PDF report with a
    watermarked PMB logo, downloaded through an authenticated proxy route.

